{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d905d","chatId":"c42aab7cf40a4c8b9cf07458a01c4ddd","sessionId":null,"userId":98560,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":19122,"promptTokens":1509,"completionTokens":293,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:41"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002799956195792853,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d905c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482381798,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d905c","chatId":"c42aab7cf40a4c8b9cf07458a01c4ddd","sessionId":null,"userId":98560,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小拉的生日要来了，我给她买了一个娃娃作为惊喜。她提前两天来到我家，但我忘了把床头柜上的礼物藏起来了。小拉看到以后大笑，说这个娃娃很丑，还开玩笑说不知道谁会花钱买这种娃娃。我跟她说，说不定会有人觉得这是一个不错的礼物呢，她不同意。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小拉最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 反对\nC) 生气\nD) 尴尬\nE) 反感\nF) 期待\n\n## 问题 2\n小拉为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她对这个娃娃的丑陋感到惊讶和好笑\nB) 她无法相信我送给她那么糟糕的礼物\nC) 她知道她的礼物会是什么\nD) 她喜欢开玩偶的笑话","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002799956195792853,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0cd9aa9dc5a833d905d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482381795,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"de5c915359d34a729f30d39e3c880b28"}